                                                "sense_id": "024ffb3d-55ba-3c91-a99b-6d4759114aa0",
                                                "text": "The cosmophobic equivalent of erotic phallophilia (male homosexuality) is erotic phallophobia, that is, the fear of homosexuality, specifically of passive homosexuality, which is closely related to androphobic shame in men."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b85b09-e3f8-4d41-b3bd-2c3be2bbf49d",
                                                "sense_id": "024ffb3d-55ba-3c91-a99b-6d4759114aa0",
                                                "text": "Fetta did seem upset and appeared to have a case of phallophobia, commingled, I thought, with a splash of phallophilia because he seemed miffed about instances of exposed male genitalia in some of my publications."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a778d3-369f-4ebd-9813-2c145582f5f1",
                                                "sense_id": "024ffb3d-55ba-3c91-a99b-6d4759114aa0",
                                                "text": "Say hello to a phalanx of fellows whose phallophilia lies fallow on the hollow feather pillow."
